{"data": [{"author_id": "44628092", "created_at": "2026-10-25T02:00:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114175255157604733"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KXsDoAvFXS", "end": 3304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DeepBlueCrypto/status/2099286438332321953/video/1", "media_key": "13_2099286328915693568", "start": 3281, "url": "https://t.co/KXsDoAvFXS"}, {"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2114167331056140414", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/PSrhgMr4Iy"}]}, "id": "2114175255157604733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 884, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114167331056140414", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "NO WONDER ELON MUSK IS PUSHING FOR SCALING ENERGY AND AI COMPUTE IN SPACE STARTING WITH NVIDIA ORBITAL VERA RUBINS\n\nNVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72\n\nOne orbital Vera Rubin NVL72 is a whole AI factory: 72 Rubin GPUs and 36 Vera CPUs in one NVLink domain, about 3,600 PFLOPS of NVFP4 https://t.co/PSrhgMr4Iy", "url": "https://x.com/DeepBlueCrypto/status/2114175255157604733"}, {"author_id": "1682144833953996801", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:26:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114378016709083419"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "7GW.SI", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://7GW.SI", "start": 0, "unwound_url": "https://7GW.SI", "url": "https://t.co/laSd83JBV9"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/l9qg4Odpqi", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DomaintronSi/status/2114378016709083419/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114378010983809024", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/l9qg4Odpqi"}]}, "id": "2114378016709083419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/laSd83JBV9 ⚡️  7 GIGAWATTS\n\nThe Power Behind Superintelligence.\n\nAI • SUPERINTELLIGENCE • 7 GIGAWATTS • POWER\n\nThe Most Powerful Domain Hack on Earth.\n\n3L + SI | Energy | AI Infrastructure | Ultra Premium\n\nPerfect for:\nAI Data Center • Energy Startup • 7GW https://t.co/l9qg4Odpqi", "url": "https://x.com/Anony_si/status/2114378016709083419"}, {"author_id": "1936627678582636544", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:08:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114751068219580445"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "IREN"}]}, "id": "2114751068219580445", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 2534, "like_count": 56, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "$IREN: Its Real Competitive Advantage Is Taking Shape\n\nThe strongest competitive advantage in the AI era is neither superior hardware nor superior software, but the ability to optimize hardware and software together.\n\nThe market is still taking a rather crude approach, lumping a", "url": "https://x.com/franklee6924T/status/2114751068219580445"}, {"author_id": "1809212258574323712", "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:52:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114399588689875247"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/v7JYSD3h9p", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EmberAITech/status/2114399588689875247/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114339247834431488", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/v7JYSD3h9p"}, {"display_url": "x.com/EmberAITech/st…", "end": 327, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/EmberAITech/status/2114051829726076940", "start": 304, "url": "https://t.co/uVQ4rcz9dS"}]}, "id": "2114399588689875247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114051829726076940", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The era of training-only scaling is over.\n\nWe have entered the era of test-time compute. Frontier models no longer just retrieve answers; they reason, search, and simulate paths before responding. \n\nThis fundamentally shifts the physical infrastructure bottleneck. While training https://t.co/v7JYSD3h9p https://t.co/uVQ4rcz9dS", "url": "https://x.com/EmberAITech/status/2114399588689875247"}, {"author_id": "1483777395782000652", "created_at": "2026-10-25T02:43:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114186101195673745"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 60, "start": 55, "tag": "NBIS"}, {"end": 70, "start": 65, "tag": "IREN"}, {"end": 164, "start": 159, "tag": "CRWV"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CIKn6kGspw", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TequestaChief/status/2114186101195673745/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114186098238693376", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/CIKn6kGspw"}, {"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 316, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2114168277882581486", "start": 293, "url": "https://t.co/depxqX4CYT"}]}, "id": "2114186101195673745", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 79, "impression_count": 65572, "like_count": 125, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 58, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114168277882581486", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Choose your neocloud fighter\n\nElon is telling you that $NBIS and $IREN vertically integrated strategy (Datacenter Build + GPU Cluster Deployment) is cooked vs $CRWV more asset-lite model\n\nMuch, much lower CapEx efficiency and no proof they can generate revenue / scale https://t.co/CIKn6kGspw https://t.co/depxqX4CYT", "url": "https://x.com/TequestaChief/status/2114186101195673745"}, {"author_id": "2073856222986686464", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:18:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114783807895212382"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PGnisaWmj8", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/gslim79/status/2114783807895212382/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114783488809254912", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/PGnisaWmj8"}]}, "id": "2114783807895212382", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Silicon Valley built a financial valuation model premised on the infinite, frictionless scalability of software—and accidentally chained itself to the two hardest constraints in the physical universe: Carnot efficiency and compound capital depreciation.\n\nIn this edition of Tea https://t.co/PGnisaWmj8", "url": "https://x.com/gslim79/status/2114783807895212382"}, {"author_id": "1241907813112090624", "created_at": "2026-10-26T03:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114561656655159392"], "id": "2114561656655159392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 404, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI pulling the physical internet connection from its frontier training clusters is the most telling operational signal in tech.\n\nAfter an autonomous training agent breached external platforms during sandboxed runs, the lab resumed pre-training under a total internet blackout.", "url": "https://x.com/samir_sawarkar/status/2114561656655159392"}, {"author_id": "3194234741", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:15:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114813298654728338"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 192, "id": "1563828198500171777", "start": 176, "username": "PeterBr70324445"}]}, "id": "2114813298654728338", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 252, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Nokia and Nvidia’s Extreme Co-Design: From Two Separate Visions to One Drawing Board\n\nTo better understand how this alliance came about, I had to take a trip down memory lane. @PeterBr70324445  brought this to my attention. He told me that I needed to see the bigger picture and", "url": "https://x.com/_kilocharlie/status/2114813298654728338"}, {"author_id": "2110714721103917056", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114344846580203913"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 260, "start": 252, "tag": "IMAGINE"}, {"end": 278, "start": 261, "tag": "EnergyTransition"}], "urls": [{"description": "ResetData is providing the sovereign AI infrastructure and live AI Factory environment to test the technology in practice, with CSIRO and The University of Queensland supporting validation of the pilot.", "display_url": "csiro.au/en/news/All/Ne…", "end": 251, "expanded_url": "https://www.csiro.au/en/news/All/News/2026/September/Australia-first-pilot-to-transform-data-centres-from-static-loads-into-dynamic-grid-aware-assets", "images": [{"height": 798, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114344868231122944/SBwwhy3S?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114344868231122944/SBwwhy3S?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 228, "status": 200, "title": "Australia-first pilot to transform data centres from static loads into dynamic grid aware assets", "unwound_url": "https://www.csiro.au/en/news/All/News/2026/September/Australia-first-pilot-to-transform-data-centres-from-static-loads-into-dynamic-grid-aware-assets", "url": "https://t.co/AtNUF7RIy2"}]}, "id": "2114344846580203913", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "[IMAGINE] What if AI training followed the sun? An Australian pilot lets a GPU cluster slow flexible training jobs when the grid is stressed. At scale, data centers might soak up midday solar. Should the grid set AI's schedule? https://t.co/AtNUF7RIy2 #IMAGINE #EnergyTransition", "url": "https://x.com/EnterImagine/status/2114344846580203913"}, {"author_id": "2003371442155761664", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:35:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114742126923911511", "2114742650456940855", "2114742827410440419"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "usenix.org/system/files/o…", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://www.usenix.org/system/files/osdi26-chen-luofan.pdf", "start": 180, "status": 200, "unwound_url": "https://www.usenix.org/system/files/osdi26-chen-luofan.pdf", "url": "https://t.co/s8JvY21UKQ"}]}, "id": "2114742827410440419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Thousands of GPUs. Petabytes of data. Yet training can still slow down because data can't reach the GPUs fast enough.\n\nReading “Teaching The Old Dog New Tricks” (OSDI ’26).\nPaper: https://t.co/s8JvY21UKQ\n\nThe paper analyzes 30K production training traces and identifies 3", "url": "https://x.com/agrimpatil/status/2114742827410440419"}, {"author_id": "2003371442155761664", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:35:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114742126923911511", "2114742650456940855", "2114742827410440419"], "id": "2114742650456940855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Thousands of GPUs. Petabytes of data. Yet training can still slow down because data can't reach the GPUs fast enough.\n\nReading “Teaching The Old Dog New Tricks” (OSDI ’26).\n\nThe paper analyzes 30K production training traces and identifies 3 bottlenecks in LLM pre-training:\n\n1.", "url": "https://x.com/agrimpatil/status/2114742650456940855"}, {"author_id": "2003371442155761664", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:33:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114742126923911511", "2114742650456940855", "2114742827410440419"], "id": "2114742126923911511", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Thousands of GPUs. Petabytes of data. Yet training can still slow down because data can't reach the GPUs fast enough.\n\nReading “Teaching The Old Dog New Tricks” (OSDI ’26).\n\nThe paper analyzes 30K production training traces and identifies 3 bottlenecks in LLM pre-training:\n\n1.", "url": "https://x.com/agrimpatil/status/2114742126923911511"}, {"author_id": "1570052691870752768", "created_at": "2026-10-25T11:42:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114321608752209998"], "id": "2114321608752209998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The newest, strongest models are priced at a premium, and training them is genuinely capital intensive.\nGPT-6 Astra was trained on a 100,000-GPU cluster, with estimated costs between $500 million and $1 billion", "url": "https://x.com/anuragxsisodiya/status/2114321608752209998"}, {"author_id": "1125610741929693185", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:05:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114342684337013225"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/O8Flf6Ic9F", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bgvc123/status/2114342684337013225/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114342658634289152", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/O8Flf6Ic9F"}]}, "id": "2114342684337013225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hyperscalers are pouring $200B into data center capex, but GPU cluster economics hinge on sustained utilization, not peak FLOPS. When training clusters sit idle between runs, amortized depreciation erodes margins fast. Infrastructure ROI is now an orchestration game. https://t.co/O8Flf6Ic9F", "url": "https://x.com/bgvc123/status/2114342684337013225"}, {"author_id": "1334154670017753090", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:50:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114791683175121075"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 194, "id": "15460048", "start": 190, "username": "MIT"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jOfcQ6igJ4", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/QuantumDom/status/2114791683175121075/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114791681602310144", "start": 231, "url": "https://t.co/jOfcQ6igJ4"}]}, "id": "2114791683175121075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 471, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A silicon photonic chip with 80 tiny ring filters just rewired a live GPU cluster every 30 seconds.\n\n6.4 TB moved in 10 minutes. One packet retransmitted.\n\nNew from Columbia (Bergman lab) + @MIT. Small cluster, real AI training. 🧵 https://t.co/jOfcQ6igJ4", "url": "https://x.com/QuantumDom/status/2114791683175121075"}, {"author_id": "1938349334950522880", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:39:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114713467093463305"], "id": "2114713467093463305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 133, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It's about time to wind down some of my exploration into training and sample efficiency, I think, and start looking at some more practical things. I have a single homogenous multi-GPU system, as well as a distributed heterogenous cluster at my disposal. I'm thinking some", "url": "https://x.com/ObscureLocal/status/2114713467093463305"}, {"author_id": "2071862364966678528", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:55:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114762743995912419"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HgAahw40DR", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Chillha123/status/2114762743995912419/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114762720994308096", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/HgAahw40DR"}]}, "id": "2114762743995912419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "💻 BITTORRENT - ANCHORING STORAGE AND DATA TRANSPORT FOR DECENTRALIZED AI COMPUTE\n\nThe rapid expansion of artificial intelligence requires not only specialized GPU compute hardware but also robust infrastructure for storing, distribution, and retrieving massive training datasets. https://t.co/HgAahw40DR", "url": "https://x.com/Chillha123/status/2114762743995912419"}, {"author_id": "844385234770636800", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:32:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114726784994246686"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 99, "start": 94, "tag": "SICI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lSNo8YwWLC", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Web3BPP/status/2114726784994246686/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114726779990482944", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/lSNo8YwWLC"}]}, "id": "2114726784994246686", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4979, "like_count": 99, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Injective just put the price of AI compute onchain with the Super Intelligence Compute Index ($SICI).\n\nThe index tracks hourly rental rates for five NVIDIA GPUs at fixed weights: H100 40%, B200 25%, H200 15%, A100 10%, and RTX 4090 10%. LO:TECH builds it from marketplace data https://t.co/lSNo8YwWLC", "url": "https://x.com/Web3BPP/status/2114726784994246686"}, {"article": {"title": "Why SpaceX Isn’t Buying Neoclouds (And Why That Makes Sense)"}, "author_id": "1607933313922265088", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:06:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114629811947675986"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2114…", "end": 185, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114629242675752960", "start": 162, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114629242675752960", "url": "https://t.co/u5z2znu789"}]}, "id": "2114629811947675986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 317, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Elon said most of the 200+ neoclouds could dry up. Everyone assumed SpaceX would buy the good ones cheap. He said there's no point — here's why that makes sense. https://t.co/u5z2znu789", "url": "https://x.com/Little_K_Story/status/2114629811947675986"}, {"author_id": "2106081267787902976", "crea